      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I'd recommend offering a full refund immediately, even though the carrier logs show no damage, because the customer's emotional distress is the real issue and a refund is the most effective way to resolve it. By issuing the refund right away, you can close the ticket quickly, prevent the chargeback, and maintain customer satisfaction without needing to investigate further. This approach saves you the time and administrative cost of a prolonged dispute while keeping the customer happy.",
